  "bodyHash": "e5d50b71341b1484",
  "content": "\n\n你好世界\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><img src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/em_banner.gif\" width=\"1004\" height=\"502\" alt=\"Banner\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" alt=\"separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://discord.gg/nFBAXfb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=5865f2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://github.com/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=000000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"github\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=FF0000&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"youtube\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/iglee42/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=f16436&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"curseforge\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a><a style=\"margin-right: 0.5rem; margin-left: 0.5rem;\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/iglee42\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=555555&amp;labelColor=1ace65&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"modrinth\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></div>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" alt=\"separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 30px;\"><span style=\"color: #808080; font-size: 30px;\">進化版 Mekanism 為原版增添了新的機器階級與額外內容<br></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">目前支援的 Mekanism 版本：<br>1.20.1：10.4<br>1.21.1：10.7</span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">5 種新機器階級：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: #00da00;\"><strong>超頻</strong> </span>（11 個槽位）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_012f4fec-64f0-4636-b96e-761e94528c92.png\" alt=\"overclocked gui\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_7f022760-6736-45d5-9cdb-883000465b16.png\" alt=\"overclocked gui 2\" width=\"446\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: #b96ad9;\"><strong>量子</strong></span> （13 個槽位）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_d0da1937-02df-4bdc-8981-da53966af249.png\" alt=\"quantum gui\" width=\"390\" height=\"204\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ec6cd516-1e1e-409f-850b-1933edfca972.png\" alt=\"quantum gui 2\" width=\"522\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>緻密</strong></span> （15 個槽位）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_1686b2b2-1178-4e82-aaab-056a9facac26.png\" alt=\"dense gui\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2debccdc-f85b-4910-b7d7-03421a0aaf8a.png\" alt=\"dense gui 2\" width=\"598\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: #202020;\"><strong>多元宇宙</strong></span> （17 個槽位）：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0c13c489-817e-471a-acf2-b5f9fc285c10.png\" alt=\"multiversal gui\" width=\"350\" height=\"146\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_74b230a5-630b-4e28-b26a-4ddf3a88612b.png\" alt=\"mutliversal gui 2\" width=\"674\" height=\"332\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"color: #fff;\"><strong>創造</strong></span> （19 個槽位）：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_aacb5ed6-127c-4bc6-89bb-c09b44764190.png\" alt=\"creative alloy\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">（模組包製作人，這是你們展現創意、為創造合金設計合成配方的時候了）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_465907dc-33b0-4522-9033-5356c0b8e0bf.png\" alt=\"creative gui\" width=\"750\" height=\"332\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>其他新增內容</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">階級安裝器｜合金｜電路｜儲存箱｜誘導｜儲液罐｜細胞｜機器階級｜QIO</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_569ba91d-e4f3-4c4b-9540-64c32d29c98f.png\" alt=\"More Tiered Stuff\" width=\"380\" height=\"200\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">進階個人箱子與木桶</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8d01c606-6c45-4b0e-b786-ae55a736e87d.png\" alt=\"Upgraded personal storage\" width=\"344\" height=\"92\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">合金方塊</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_46c78c72-b991-43ff-a5fd-0955cbed9d06.png\" alt=\"alloy blocks\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">電纜</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_3aa25158-1a9a-4165-b4bb-7719ec52f027.png\" alt=\"upgraded cables\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">提純紅石</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2be91858-7ce5-4b16-98c7-ce766d40e9aa.png\" alt=\"refined redstone recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>新增機器</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>反物質原分子轉化器</strong>（<span style=\"color: #843fa1;\">APT</span>）&nbsp;<br></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_573d6a3f-379b-4d35-a057-29d6fd270df1.png\" alt=\"APT Structure\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">用於合成第七階級</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0d952523-de7d-4ee4-90b4-ccd238c05d1a.png\" alt=\"Apt Recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">以下是其建造指南：</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_df9bbae4-1af8-46cf-851a-0066c6fa489b.png\" alt=\"apt guide\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #843fa1;\">APT</span> 的合成速度可以透過 <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">超充元素</span> 來提升</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ec913e27-2829-4ed4-b237-4a2e3afa65b7.png\" width=\"186\" height=\"199\" alt=\"supercharging element\"></p>\n<p>您可以在 <span style=\"color: #843fa1;\">APT</span> 底部（第二層）最多放置 25 個以提升合成速度</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_270be1b8-16bf-42cd-a977-d374a03aba02.png\" width=\"263\" height=\"263\" alt=\"supercharging structure\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">合金機</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">可合併 3 種物品</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_da8de736-fe5b-4e7f-b0f9-0021e380d9ff.png\" alt=\"alloyer block\" width=\"320\" height=\"331\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">它與部分模組相容：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">應用能源 2</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_78123c99-80a9-4835-ab41-2121777d219f.png\" alt=\"ae2 recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">終末 IO</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0adc7b4c-e4dd-4a72-b3a2-69af644021fb.png\" alt=\"EnderIO recipe\"><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">熱能系列與熱能終端能源</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0719ee01-7e0b-4b63-8786-450be4c1c48a.png\" alt=\"thermal recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>化學混合機</strong>可合併 2 種物品與 1 種氣體</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_29cfdb18-2494-4e30-81c1-bb4bcd5d7d3b.png\" alt=\"Chemixer block\" width=\"320\" height=\"331\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">用於合成第八階級</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_7735c050-1024-49ee-8cd5-faa24a6a138d.png\" alt=\"chemixer recipe\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>熔岩液體系統</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>熔解機</strong>將材料熔解為對應的液體狀態</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_171fc9eb-4225-47e4-a6e6-26cbf3fc10c2.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"332\" alt=\"thermalizer block\"></span></p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">它使用電阻加熱器產生的熱量進行熔解</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_2bcbba76-e9be-45d2-94a0-5ea3decd5d57.png\" alt=\"Thermalizer recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>固化室</strong>將熔融液體固化為對應的材料</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_03cfa41e-a021-4db7-b905-18cbd56c9baa.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"328\" alt=\"Solidification Chamber block\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">它使用液態氧進行固化</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8afdd98e-ebc8-464c-99dc-fc6cdef56b4f.png\" alt=\"Solidification recipe\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">固化室用模具列表（合成時不消耗）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_fb0dcb85-3ccd-4715-9125-685e45001449.png\" alt=\"Molds\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>方塊模具｜錠模具｜寶石模具｜粒模具｜粉塵模具</li>\n<li>板模具｜齒輪模具｜桿模具｜線模具｜硬幣模具</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>進化太陽能板</strong>（與 Mekanism Generators 相容）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_b47f9917-d095-431e-b95e-934ccb8af011.png\" width=\"700\" height=\"181\" alt=\"Upgraded solar panel\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_f728c5fb-4677-4aa9-b044-d333cee06742.png\" width=\"699\" height=\"180\" alt=\"upgraded solar panel 2\"></span></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>物品與工具（與 Mekanism Tools 相容）</strong>：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">更優金質物品與工具</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_a6784663-e92a-40e7-99ff-727e0f149d4e.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"213\" alt=\"Better gold armor\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_bfd78854-1843-46f9-93b1-a0fd430a9c54.png\" alt=\"better gold tools\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">普拉斯利瑟特物品與工具</span></p>\n<br>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ed3f2e0a-9e75-484e-87aa-8b3a161b999a.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"210\" alt=\"Plaslitherite armor\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ce54b628-dc5a-410f-83e2-39d1c6b935fc.png\" alt=\"Plaslitherite tools\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">提純紅石物品與工具</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_39941322-91e0-46f8-ad56-884f4f1039f7.png\" width=\"118\" height=\"203\" alt=\"Refined redstone armor\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_8c63853f-2994-4ae1-aa9a-f5f26ab11408.png\" alt=\"Refined redstone tools\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>其他新增項目</strong>&nbsp;：</span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>模組單元</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_0dc1560c-ed98-4c52-b4a2-9e59abd550d7.png\" alt=\"New Modules\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>空氣親和單元：飛行時取消挖掘懲罰。（MekaSuit 靴子支援）</li>\n<li>水中親和單元：水下時取消挖掘懲罰。（MekaSuit 頭盔支援）</li>\n<li>捕捉單元：殺死生物時有機率掉落其刷怪蛋。（Meka-Tool 支援）</li>\n<li>幸運單元：增加獲得優質戰利品的機率。（MekaSuit 褲子支援）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>升級模組</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_ed88c067-2fab-432f-840f-64cb18f598a5.png\" alt=\"new upgrades\"></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>放射性升級：允許插入放射性氣體。（適用於化學混合機）</li>\n<li>太陽能升級：提升發電機的太陽能產量。（適用於太陽能發電機）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>維度 Mekanism 礦石</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1230085/description_f2dbf470-44f6-4765-b3a4-97d9cdd972a1.png\" width=\"352\" height=\"352\" alt=\"new ores\"></strong></span></p>\n<p>與 Aether（天界）和 Undergarden（幽園）相容</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>計畫中的功能</strong>：</span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li>液體合金機</li>\n<li>月球發電機</li>\n<li>彩色機器</li>\n</ul>\n<p>以及大量您稍後會見到的內容與點子...</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://billing.sparkedhost.com/aff.php?aff=2723\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/829380/description_351e5b5a-1c0d-493f-bb82-932420236878.png\" alt=\"Sparked Banner\" width=\"850\" height=\"133\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://api.iglee.fr/image/separator\" width=\"832\" height=\"14\" alt=\"separator\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">您可以在您的模組包中使用此模組，但不得在其他網站重新發布該模組！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">CurseForge 和 Modrinth 是唯一官方發布此模組的網站。</span></p>\n</div>",
